close_reason: The extension test harness applies the native read-output admission to the same effective result native output admits
contract_change:
  api: runRegisteredCommandForTest and createExtensionTestHarness().runCommand for commands that declare read_output; assertExtensionReadOutputResult
  before: "The harness returned handled: true for a result missing its declared row collections, which the native CLI refuses with extension_read_output_invalid before formatting"
  after: "The harness applies the native admission to the result a registered command-result override and a structured output_format replacement deliver (skipping suppressed host output, honouring an explicit outputFormat), and throws the same extension_read_output_invalid refusal"
  migrate: A command that renders a compact receipt keeps returning its declared rows (an empty collection is valid) and lets its output_format service render the receipt
